	'k50f29786' => 'Niuke Scan ends that dispute before the truck leaves your yard. By scanning every carton code the moment it crosses the threshold of the dock door, your receiving team confirms the shipment against the purchase order in real time. Missing items, extra packages, and visible carton damage are flagged instantly with a photo, turning a potential week of arguing into a clear, resolved receiving record.',
	'k51431049' => 'We believe the only way to evaluate intake hardware is on a live dock floor. You can start a 30-day dock trial on either the Single Door or Shift plan completely free of charge. Your pre-configured N1 scanner kit ships within 5 working days. Test it with your incoming deliveries, train your receiving staff, and review supplier reports. If you decide not to keep it, return the equipment using our prepaid return postage.',
