	'kd8c0b0eb' => 'The swappable battery pack powers the N1 through a full 12-hour shift of regular scanning activity. If the battery is depleted, it recharges to full capacity in 2.5 hours using the USB-C cable or the optional four-bay charging cradle. For round-the-clock dock facilities or multiple shifts, extra swappable battery packs are available for €45 one-off, allowing workers to swap packs instantly without taking the scanner out of service.',
	'kd909b5be' => 'How long does a battery last?',
	'kd95ec069' => 'SPEC',
	'kda2fcb1e' => 'Logins',
	'kdaa4ae2b' => 'The N1 lifts off its charging cradle ready for a full twelve-hour shift. Weighing just 280 grams, the balanced enclosure sits comfortably in the hand across hundreds of repetitive scans. The soft rubber grip prevents slips on chilly mornings, while physical trigger buttons deliver tactile feedback through work gloves. Its compact profile fits easily into a pocket or clips directly to a work belt when workers need both hands free to handle heavy cartons or reposition pallet jacks.',
	'kdb5187ba' => 'Pay per door.<br>Cancel any month.',
	'kdb5c6687' => 'Simple, predictable pricing structured by dock doors rather than complicated per-scan fees. Every subscription includes hardware and software with no setup fee.',
