	'kdedd4e98' => 'Trial fulfillment and support response times',
	'ke0b96955' => '€89 / month',
	'ke103ac5c' => 'Completing setup takes about 2 hours by following five straightforward steps. First, unpack the hardware and insert the charged battery into the N1 scanner. Second, mount the wall clip or charging cradle near your dock door workbench. Third, connect the scanner to your local Wi-Fi 6 network or pair via Bluetooth 5.3. Fourth, open Count Sheet on your phone, tablet, or browser and create your team user accounts. Fifth, import your first purchase order via CSV or forwarded email to run a test count.',
	'ke2c40815' => 'To request your 30-day dock trial, provide your name, work email address, company name, number of loading doors (select 1 door, 2 to 3 doors, or 4 to 8 doors), and preferred working language. You can select English, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, French, or German. Our team reviews your dock profile and prepares your trial kit on either the Single Door or Shift plan free for 30 days, with no setup fee.',
	'ke3bc732f' => 'Timestamped',
	'ke4208c61' => 'Every number,<br>in one place.',
