	'ke7fe9562' => 'Work email',
	'ke8875677' => 'Dock environments frequently suffer from dead zones and metal trailer interference. The N1 maintains continuous operation with an internal offline queue that stores up to 2,000 scans when wireless connection drops. When back in range via Wi-Fi 6 or Bluetooth 5.3, the scanner seamlessly synchronizes queued records with Count Sheet without losing a single line item. A built-in photo note camera allows dock receivers to photograph damaged cartons on the spot.',
