	'keb8fe64e' => '12-hour shift',
	'kebda4dac' => 'The swappable battery powers a 12-hour shift and charges to full in 2.5 hours. Swappable spares and four-bay charging cradles are available.',
	'kec1e941d' => 'Every plan comes with our complete dock package to ensure your team is operational immediately. There is never any setup fee, and you can cancel your subscription in any month without penalty. Hardware ships within 5 working days, and setup takes about 2 hours in a single afternoon. If your team requires assistance, our support team is available Monday through Friday from 06:00 to 18:00 CET during dock operating hours.',
	'kec86b476' => 'Hardware orders and trial kits ship from Rotterdam within 5 working days of request. New customers may evaluate the Single Door or Shift plan for 30 days free of charge. If you decide not to proceed with a paid subscription, all provided hardware must be returned within 14 days of trial expiration using our supplied free return postage label. Hardware damaged beyond standard dock wear and tear or unreturned items may incur replacement fees.',
